<body>
    <h1>High-Volume SAP Sales Order Loading Architecture from SKP Using BAP=
I Processing</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 local-id=3D"5f7aa483" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArch=
itecturefromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-High-VolumeSAPBusinessObjectLoadingfromS=
KP">High-Volume SAP Business Object Loading from SKP</h1>
<p local-id=3D"43774598"><em>Status:</em> Target-State Architecture Proposa=
l</p>
<p local-id=3D"4aa89226"><em>Primary example:</em> Sales orders using <code=
>BAPI_SALESORDER_CREATEFROMDAT2</code></p>
<p local-id=3D"4fafeed6"><em>Reusable scope:</em> Purchase orders, deliveri=
es, business partners, production orders, and other SAP business objects</p=
>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"5192ec8b"><strong>Executive decision</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"0a68d923">Build a reusable SKP SAP Business Object Loader th=
at stages migration-ready data in SAP-like relational tables, packages each=
 complete business object into an immutable chunk, invokes one typed RFC pe=
r chunk, and returns SAP keys and <code>BAPIRET2</code> messages with full =
auditability.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"7b5d16bf" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-ExecutiveSummary">Executive Summary</h2>
<p local-id=3D"2f48d810">The recommended architecture preserves standard SA=
P business logic while removing unnecessary migration-framework overhead. I=
t uses flat collections passed together in a single chunk package rather th=
an nested JSON as the primary transport.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"64d0840e" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Recommendedapproach">Recommended approach</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"02a67e2d">
<li local-id=3D"716a8dfe">
<p local-id=3D"08e449fb">SKP stores migration-ready data in SAP-like relati=
onal tables.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6c4962c4">
<p local-id=3D"7c6d20a1">A manifest identifies one complete, immutable busi=
ness-object chunk.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3b928d89">
<p local-id=3D"4f905c3c">Replicate reads every table belonging to that chun=
k.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4718dea0">
<p local-id=3D"291f1886">Replicate makes one typed RFC invocation per chunk=
, passing the tables as separate flat collections.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1815c717">
<p local-id=3D"66d1f7a1">A custom ABAP wrapper reconstructs each business o=
bject, executes the standard BAPI, commits or rolls back at the individual-=
object boundary, and returns generated SAP keys plus <code>BAPIRET2</code> =
messages.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4c45d726">
<p local-id=3D"3539b7ac">Replicate writes results back to SKP result and me=
ssage tables.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"34fd17e9">
<p local-id=3D"4269f00e">Replicate and SAP jointly enforce a bounded parall=
el-processing budget.</p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"476564af" data-table-displa=
y-mode=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2171301a">
<th data-local-id=3D"394e6c9b" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5b178124">Area</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"577667ba" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"00b22152">Recommendation</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"102cf43b">
<td data-local-id=3D"3c4e50c1" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"73ffcd15">Transport</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0e9db82f" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ba4da8f">RFC with multiple table parameters</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5d652795">
<td data-local-id=3D"604f73bb" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4c71a59b">Transaction boundary</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"27e55ed6" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0e59fc25">One SAP business object per commit</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"177083c4">
<td data-local-id=3D"2a535348" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"03b677e2">Parallelization</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"434fd95c" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4cd5b0b0">Independent chunks with bounded concurrency</p></t=
d>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0cc33f55">
<td data-local-id=3D"60fca3e3" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6a08a031">Recovery</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"24e9afb8" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5ef420f9">Idempotent retry using immutable correlation keys<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4a319412">
<td data-local-id=3D"32a8f155" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3cc56637">Monitoring</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4e4244d4" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7946292c">Result and message tables with full auditability</=
p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"4e3113cd" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-WhyaNewLoadPathIsNeeded">Why a New Load Path Is =
Needed</h2>
<p local-id=3D"7f57b82f">Traditional SAP migration technologies introduce a=
dditional layers that can reduce throughput:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"043843e0">
<li local-id=3D"0f452d06">
<p local-id=3D"3cacae30">LSMW</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"005a0917">
<p local-id=3D"19297f3c">LTMC</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6de31c2f">
<p local-id=3D"542de7ea">Migration Cockpit</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1da771fe">
<p local-id=3D"21191f1a">File-based migration objects</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"57906733">
<p local-id=3D"4d2df4ab">Generic IDoc processing</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"1cba972b">The target scale includes <strong>500,000+ sales o=
rders</strong>, millions of line items, and tens of millions of schedule li=
nes. At this scale, bottlenecks are often caused by migration-framework ove=
rhead, file handling, serialization, single-threaded execution, and generic=
 object processing.</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip=
">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"62128a29">The proposed architecture keeps SAP=E2=80=99s supp=
orted business logic while eliminating unnecessary migration layers from th=
e high-volume path.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"454efe05" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-TargetArchitecture">Target Architecture</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"651db4c7" data-table-displa=
y-mode=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1d765030">
<th data-local-id=3D"62523a1f" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"04614c9a">Plane</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"627c80e3" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3bf964c9">Primary responsibilities</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"73096b3c">
<td data-local-id=3D"6a7904fe" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"500c4795"><strong>Control plane</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"535dd29a" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7ed62429">Run management, chunk definitions, retry policies,=
 concurrency limits, status tracking, and audit logging</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"73c3a323">
<td data-local-id=3D"6b364c76" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"003654de"><strong>Data plane</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2bb1de58" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7a104a3b">SAP-like staging tables containing complete, corre=
lated business-object data</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"430a687a">
<td data-local-id=3D"09c2b865" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"48b6db96"><strong>Execution plane</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4b1c09c4" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"50723710">ABAP wrapper validation, reconstruction, BAPI mapp=
ing, execution, transaction handling, and result capture</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"20a391fa">
<td data-local-id=3D"38b27727" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1b0ba453"><strong>Result plane</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5c564e23" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"272e839f">Generated SAP keys, source correlation keys, messa=
ges, durations, and chunk status</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"41713651" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Architectureflow">Architecture flow</h3>
<p local-id=3D"626f4c9a"><strong>SKP staging tables</strong> =E2=86=92 <str=
ong>Chunk builder</strong> =E2=86=92 <strong>Replicate chunk orchestrator</=
strong> =E2=86=92 <strong>RFC load invocation</strong> =E2=86=92 <strong>SA=
P ABAP wrapper</strong> =E2=86=92 <strong>Standard SAP BAPI</strong> =E2=86=
=92 <strong>Result capture</strong> =E2=86=92 <strong>SKP monitoring and re=
conciliation</strong></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"071d3165" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Salesorderdataplane">Sales order data plane</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"1ce10cc7">
<li local-id=3D"57e309be">
<p local-id=3D"7438de5d"><code>SO_VBAK_T</code> =E2=80=94 headers</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7d79d12d">
<p local-id=3D"2c405460"><code>SO_VBAP_T</code> =E2=80=94 items</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5af3dec8">
<p local-id=3D"57158f18"><code>SO_VBEP_T</code> =E2=80=94 schedule lines</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"0b5a1780">
<p local-id=3D"3b818500"><code>SO_VBPA_T</code> =E2=80=94 partners</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"792b334e">
<p local-id=3D"62763a0e"><code>SO_CONDITION_T</code> =E2=80=94 conditions</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"51703e4c">
<p local-id=3D"3baffa28"><code>SO_TEXT_T</code> =E2=80=94 texts</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"5dc046fa" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-CanonicalSKPStagingModel">Canonical SKP Staging =
Model</h2>
<p local-id=3D"7f367f0d">All staging tables should contain the following co=
mmon metadata:</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"48d8f204" data-table-displa=
y-mode=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"49af30ad">
<th data-local-id=3D"44a952c4" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"11a05a33">Column</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"2ac751d2" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"06c85907">Purpose</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"753f6bb5">
<td data-local-id=3D"7bcf1aea" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0e3745c2"><code>RUN_ID</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"01df2b83" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1225d507">Migration run identifier</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"551453f8">
<td data-local-id=3D"46d95228" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2a64406c"><code>OBJECT_TYPE</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3d59f64c" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0680fcc2">Business-object contract</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2fc6f378">
<td data-local-id=3D"57f928d5" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"740feb13"><code>CONTRACT_VERSION</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3b33de1f" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"34fcffc0">Schema or contract version</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3dccb45c">
<td data-local-id=3D"7e37cb73" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"519ebbde"><code>SOURCE_OBJECT_ID</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2b296da4" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6026f58e">Immutable source correlation key</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"65bef446">
<td data-local-id=3D"0d8e7f0f" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3fa5866c"><code>SOURCE_PARENT_ID</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"654f9fec" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"121fecf1">Parent relationship key</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0fe2a9fb">
<td data-local-id=3D"46c41d7c" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3f593a49"><code>ZCHUNK</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"579af8e4" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0864b97f">Chunk ownership key</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7f3e49e8">
<td data-local-id=3D"4dc07d1a" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6d144190"><code>SEQUENCE_NO</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"62ffe290" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1daf1a6d">Deterministic record ordering</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"378fc2cc">
<td data-local-id=3D"60d61628" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"74e4f952"><code>LOAD_STATUS</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7ba80d0a" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7684b192">Current processing state</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"52709ab5">
<td data-local-id=3D"5f1e82d9" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"441f11d9"><code>ATTEMPT_NO</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7d251dfa" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2803126a">Retry attempt count</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"395a6002">
<td data-local-id=3D"4e20f43b" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4550e269"><code>DATA_HASH</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5febb57e" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"24be06e3">Payload integrity and idempotency value</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"794984c3">
<td data-local-id=3D"3900dc4f" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"41bfcf31"><code>CREATED_TS</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"51e22bd9" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1119b787">Creation timestamp</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1e0986d6">
