<h2 local-id=3D"42f324e9" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-ChunkingStrategy">Chunking Strategy</h2>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"6717efc6"><strong>Chunk by header.</strong> Do not independe=
ntly select TOP N rows from each table. Every chunk must contain complete b=
usiness objects and all related child records.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"79637669"><strong>Example:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"65b5815d">
<li local-id=3D"763db2cf">
<p local-id=3D"3770355b"><strong>Chunk 1:</strong> 1,000 headers, all relat=
ed items, and all related schedule lines</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"133b3039">
<p local-id=3D"48d03bf2"><strong>Chunk 2:</strong> the next 1,000 headers, =
all related items, and all related schedule lines</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"320acd7f"><code>ZCHUNK</code> must be propagated from each h=
eader to all child records. This prevents cross-chunk relationships and mak=
es each chunk independently restartable.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"338a8fa1" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Weightedchunking">Weighted chunking</h3>
<p local-id=3D"1cebeee5">Chunk size should consider header count, item coun=
t, schedule count, condition count, and total payload size.</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: text; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">ChunkWe=
ight =3D HeaderCount
            + ItemWeight * ItemCount
            + ScheduleWeight * ScheduleCount
            + ConditionWeight * ConditionCount</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"1bcf9754" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-TransportModelEvaluation">Transport Model Evalua=
tion</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"1d87f7fc" data-table-displa=
y-mode=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2a0f4b5f">
<th data-local-id=3D"78afb24b" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"55c56786">Model</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"5127599e" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"390be109">Recommendation</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"317df17d">
<td data-local-id=3D"577cb460" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3e7391b7">Nested JSON</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"03d965c3" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3e71b879">Not preferred</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6fcc76a8">
<td data-local-id=3D"12c72e26" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"750cb048">Flat collections in JSON</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4ca542e5" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"355dbd8a">Good for logical representation</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2778c4d1">
<td data-local-id=3D"0cd07c02" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"75216cc6">Multiple files</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"08b21778" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"475597c3">Compatibility only</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"758408f4">
<td data-local-id=3D"17863faf" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"251cd4e8">Separate calls per table</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"103a4808" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"07799346">Avoid</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3e494c18">
<td data-local-id=3D"156a7fe0" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"46025ec8">SAP staging tables</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"33921ce2" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"26507a7c">Optional</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"342f8237">
<td data-local-id=3D"116c8042" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5bf3ce59">RFC table parameters</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"35ac3a8b" valign=3D"top" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"77de399c">Recommended primary transport</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"37de5cd9" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Recommendedtransportcontract">Recommended transp=
ort contract</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
  "manifest": {},
  "headers": [],
  "items": [],
  "schedules": [],
  "partners": [],
  "conditions": []
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"03c94525"><em>Logical representation only. The actual implem=
entation should use RFC table parameters.</em></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"11d58a05" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-MigrationSQLDeveloperResponsibilities">Migration=
 SQL Developer Responsibilities</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"641dc378" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Datashaping">Data shaping</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"2732097b">
<li local-id=3D"7ab3ee90">
<p local-id=3D"3c4272f6">Normalize SAP formats</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"23b21fa7">
<p local-id=3D"44cdaa70">Generate item numbers</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2b622eaf">
<p local-id=3D"1ef3a048">Generate schedule numbers</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"46230364">
<p local-id=3D"77646af7">Build partner records</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5e92c06f">
<p local-id=3D"670fdecf">Build condition records</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"29cd0ad0">
<p local-id=3D"3d429968">Eliminate duplicates</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"5f60a5d3" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Relationshipintegrity">Relationship integrity</h=
3>
<p local-id=3D"3251d800">Validate that the header exists, each item belongs=
 to its header, each schedule line belongs to its item, no relationships cr=
oss chunk boundaries, and no records are orphaned.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"1d079de5" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Validation">Validation</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"2e878e7a">
<li local-id=3D"0e58fe09">
<p local-id=3D"6969d89d">Mandatory field checks</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"45f2e24c">
<p local-id=3D"49054305">Domain validations</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6361414b">
<p local-id=3D"034818d5">Organizational assignment checks</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6e2bf1cb">
<p local-id=3D"573e4c69">Cross-field validations</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"05df8fa4">
<p local-id=3D"0d5dc482">Quantity consistency checks</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"320f68e5" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Reconciliation">Reconciliation</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"7ebd3f89">
<li local-id=3D"24d309c3">
<p local-id=3D"1f3b0e2b">Source counts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"02585ae8">
<p local-id=3D"3eeb4f89">Loaded counts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"200e97c8">
<p local-id=3D"62b21a1e">Success counts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5b30a4c7">
<p local-id=3D"0deb1bfa">Failure counts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3abe4cf5">
<p local-id=3D"51f7d49e">Exception reports</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"249932c7" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-ReplicateDesign">Replicate Design</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"75a065b0" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Recommendedmappingmodel">Recommended mapping mod=
el</h3>
<p local-id=3D"5906c049">Replicate should bind multiple source tables to a =
single load function:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
  "objectType": "SALES_ORDER",
  "loadFunction": "Z_SKP_BO_LOAD_CHUNK",
  "bindings": [
    { "source": "SO_VBAK_T", "parameter": "IT_HEADERS" },
    { "source": "SO_VBAP_T", "parameter": "IT_ITEMS" },
    { "source": "SO_VBEP_T", "parameter": "IT_SCHEDULES" },
    { "source": "SO_VBPA_T", "parameter": "IT_PARTNERS" },
    { "source": "SO_CONDITION_T", "parameter": "IT_CONDITIONS" }
  ]
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"354b9fa5" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Runtimeprocess">Runtime process</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"6f7e38ca">
<li local-id=3D"539b6353">
<p local-id=3D"6752082e">Lease chunk</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1db7cce8">
<p local-id=3D"5a2ba10d">Read all tables for the chunk</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5c472150">
<p local-id=3D"5a60a0ea">Validate counts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"608eaae3">
<p local-id=3D"2af79ea3">Validate relationships</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5ed4c923">
<p local-id=3D"3c3ac199">Bind RFC parameters</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"04c8521a">
<p local-id=3D"37282e18">Invoke SAP load program</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6bf3c607">
<p local-id=3D"6ada3c94">Capture results</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"59b87ecb">
<p local-id=3D"4700c653">Update status</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"52402f74" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-SAPABAPWrapperDesign">SAP ABAP Wrapper Design</h=
2>
<h3 local-id=3D"1d94966a" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Interface">Interface</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">IT_HEAD=
ERS
IT_ITEMS
IT_SCHEDULES
IT_PARTNERS
IT_CONDITIONS
ET_RESULTS
ET_MESSAGES</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"1873cbf7" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Processinglogic">Processing logic</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"10cca8c3">
<li local-id=3D"3b9b011f">
<p local-id=3D"795f1a9e">Group records by <code>SOURCE_OBJECT_ID</code></p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"31d18767">
<p local-id=3D"69e1b3dd">Assemble the sales order</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5ddf6ab8">
<p local-id=3D"78c024ea">Build BAPI structures</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4abc9bab">
<p local-id=3D"55f02768">Call <code>BAPI_SALESORDER_CREATEFROMDAT2</code></=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6d61959e">
<p local-id=3D"18d6b3af">Evaluate <code>BAPIRET2</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"03ce1e4d">
<p local-id=3D"72633296">Commit or roll back</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"09ebe4b2">
<p local-id=3D"4bb9ad99">Capture the result</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"79cb70e3" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Commitstrategy">Commit strategy</h3>
<p local-id=3D"01e2b584"><strong>Recommended:</strong> one commit per sales=
 order.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"1857b3b6">
<li local-id=3D"6a707cf4">
<p local-id=3D"1b185a26">Simplified recovery</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3b1d9b78">
<p local-id=3D"02349c8c">Minimal rollback scope</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"12934702">
<p local-id=3D"5d63a05b">Clear ownership</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4b84cb08">
<p local-id=3D"06999dbb">Easier restartability</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"79e736ee" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-ResultHandling">Result Handling</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"1e4d696d" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Resulttable">Result table</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"21d8e953" data-table-displa=
y-mode=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
