</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"7dfd5611" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-ParallelProcessingandBenchmarking">Parallel Proc=
essing and Benchmarking</h2>
<p local-id=3D"6904df0d">Parallelism operates at two levels: Replicate chun=
k parallelism and SAP worker parallelism.</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: text; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Effecti=
veConcurrency =3D MIN(
  ReplicateInFlightChunks * SAPWorkersPerChunk,
  SAPSystemLimit
)</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"68eee2ff">Benchmark with chunks of 100, 250, 500, and 1,000 =
orders. Measure:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"6a3d3683">
<li local-id=3D"6463d373">
<p local-id=3D"7a1439c5">Orders per minute</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5ac3ff32">
<p local-id=3D"0583ff9b">Lines per minute</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1100b476">
<p local-id=3D"25464023">RFC payload size</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6a2bdc9c">
<p local-id=3D"21288f7c">SAP memory usage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0e552d7c">
<p local-id=3D"1cddcb54">Work process utilization</p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"3e094e51">Concurrency must be bounded jointly by Replicate a=
nd SAP. Increasing parallelism without capacity measurements can reduce thr=
oughput and destabilize the source system.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"39b0d8ac" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-ReusableSKPBusinessObjectLoaderFramework">Reusab=
le SKP Business Object Loader Framework</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"787aaa7e" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Corecomponents">Core components</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"5941509c">
<li local-id=3D"268e6519">
<p local-id=3D"0a682508">Object contract registry</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6a02ca61">
<p local-id=3D"1ed1120f">Chunk builder</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"60852f68">
<p local-id=3D"63ad23a9">Replicate transport adapter</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7ff8af53">
<p local-id=3D"0afabbd5">SAP object adapter</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7e0195cf">
<p local-id=3D"45b6d73f">Result and monitoring service</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"10ecb6df" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-Supportedobjects">Supported objects</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"73b59505">
<li local-id=3D"65e0e5ce">
<p local-id=3D"5048b28c">Sales orders</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2064523b">
<p local-id=3D"23e7c04d">Purchase orders</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5abce7ff">
<p local-id=3D"12a2a3cc">Deliveries</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"540061a7">
<p local-id=3D"7d57ab12">Business partners</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"13742af5">
<p local-id=3D"2662beab">Production orders</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"179bb6d4" id=3D"High-VolumeSAPSalesOrderLoadingArchitecture=
fromSKPUsingBAPIProcessing-FinalRecommendation">Final Recommendation</h2>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"45d4df97">
<li local-id=3D"1279eb74">
<p local-id=3D"5a6d8b44">Use SAP-like relational staging tables.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"23326fda">
<p local-id=3D"0a23c365">Chunk by header using <code>ZCHUNK</code>.</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"68676cfc">
<p local-id=3D"13b780a9">Pass all related collections together.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2e1919a7">
<p local-id=3D"0051fd2b">Use immutable <code>SOURCE_OBJECT_ID</code> values=
.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"39a15cef">
<p local-id=3D"027c0150">Use RFC table parameters as the primary transport.=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"693640c4">
<p local-id=3D"0ef250c7">Execute standard SAP BAPIs through custom ABAP wra=
ppers.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"027a05f5">
<p local-id=3D"2d1e59b1">Capture SAP keys and <code>BAPIRET2</code> message=
s.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3daa434f">
<p local-id=3D"5da7019e">Process chunks in parallel with bounded concurrenc=
y.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5cd9c40d">
<p local-id=3D"4eed52cb">Implement full restartability and auditability.</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"3ae21743">
<p local-id=3D"7a59df8e">Standardize the framework for all SAP business obj=
ects.</p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip=
">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"55f044c8"><strong>Success criterion</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"2b0f6185">=E2=80=9COne million complete, correlated, indepen=
dently restartable SAP business objects loaded through supported SAP interf=
aces with full auditability, reconciliation, and monitoring.=E2=80=9D</p>
</div>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
